---
id: org.dxos.plugin.recorder
name: RecorderPlugin
version: 0.1.0
---

Records the voice-over of a plugin-presenter deck while it is presented. The reader presses Record in the
presentation's toolbar; the deck presents from its first slide, the presenter shows each slide's speaker notes
(subtitles or a notes window, a presenter setting), and every slide change is logged against the take's own
clock. When the presentation ends, the take is saved as a plugin-studio `Variant` and listed, with each slide's
recorded length against its desired length, in the presentation's Recordings companion.

